   "How to use Compress PDF": "Cara memakai Kompres PDF",
   "Select your PDFs": "Pilih PDF Anda",
   ", or a folder of them.": ", atau folder berisi PDF.",
   "Pick a level, or type a target size": "Pilih level, atau ketik ukuran target",
   "such as 2 MB. The size each level gives is shown before you start.": "seperti 2 MB. Ukuran setiap level ditampilkan sebelum Anda mulai.",
   "and download, or save the smaller files into a folder.": "dan unduh, atau simpan file yang lebih kecil ke folder.",
   "How much smaller will my PDF get?": "Seberapa kecil PDF saya nanti?",
   "It depends on what is inside. Scans and photos shrink a lot, often by 60 to 90 percent. PDFs that are mostly text or CAD lines are already small and change little.": "Tergantung isinya. Pindaian dan foto menyusut banyak, sering 60 sampai 90 persen. PDF yang sebagian besar teks atau garis CAD sudah kecil dan hanya sedikit berubah.",
   "Can I compress a PDF to under 2 MB?": "Bisakah saya mengompres PDF hingga di bawah 2 MB?",
   "Yes. Choose \"Target size\" and type 2. The tool tries stronger settings until the file fits, and tells you if it cannot get that small.": "Bisa. Pilih \"Ukuran target\" dan ketik 2. Alat ini mencoba pengaturan yang lebih kuat sampai file muat, dan memberi tahu Anda jika tidak bisa sekecil itu.",
   "Does it lower the quality of text and drawings?": "Apakah kualitas teks dan gambar kerja menurun?",
   "No. Only pictures and scans are made smaller. Text, lines and vector drawings stay sharp.": "Tidak. Hanya foto dan pindaian yang diperkecil. Teks, garis, dan gambar vektor tetap tajam.",
   "Make PDF files smaller. Pick a level or a target size like 2 MB for email, and see the size of each level before you save. Many files at once, no upload, no limit.": "Perkecil file PDF. Pilih level atau ukuran target seperti 2 MB untuk email, dan lihat ukuran setiap level sebelum disimpan. Banyak file sekaligus, tanpa unggah, tanpa batas.",
   "Compress PDF to a Target Size (e.g. under 2 MB), Free | File Manager Toolkit": "Kompres PDF ke Ukuran Target (mis. di bawah 2 MB), Gratis | File Manager Toolkit",
   "Editable Word files from your PDFs, scanned ones too. Arabic stays right-to-left.": "File Word yang bisa diedit dari PDF Anda, termasuk hasil pindaian. Bahasa Arab tetap dari kanan ke kiri.",
