   "Over or under the content?": "Di atas atau di bawah konten?",
   "\"Over\" is always visible. \"Under\" sits behind text and drawings like a light background, but it can be hidden on scanned pages, which are pictures.": "\"Di atas\" selalu terlihat. \"Di bawah\" berada di belakang teks dan gambar seperti latar tipis, tetapi bisa tertutup di halaman pindaian, karena halaman itu berupa gambar.",
   "Stamp a text or image watermark on PDF pages: CONFIDENTIAL, DRAFT, your logo, in any language including Arabic. Position, size, angle and transparency. Many files at once, no upload.": "Bubuhkan watermark teks atau gambar di halaman PDF: RAHASIA, DRAFT, logo Anda, dalam bahasa apa pun termasuk Arab. Posisi, ukuran, sudut, dan transparansi. Banyak file sekaligus, tanpa unggah.",
