   "Only if the PDF asks for one": "Hanya jika PDF memintanya",
   "Files marked 🔒 need the password to open. Files that only block printing or copying are unlocked without one.": "File bertanda 🔒 butuh kata sandi untuk dibuka. File yang hanya memblokir cetak atau salin dibuka kuncinya tanpa kata sandi.",
