   "What is Title Case?": "Apa itu Title Case?",
   "Every word starts with a capital letter, like a book title: \"The Quick Brown Fox\". Sentence case only capitalises the first word of each sentence.": "Setiap kata diawali huruf kapital, seperti judul buku: \"The Quick Brown Fox\". Huruf awal kalimat hanya mengkapitalkan kata pertama setiap kalimat.",
   "Can it remove the diacritics from Arabic text?": "Bisakah menghapus harakat dari teks Arab?",
   "Yes. \"Remove Arabic diacritics\" takes out the tashkeel (fatha, damma, kasra, shadda and the rest) and the tatweel, and keeps the letters.": "Ya. \"Hapus harakat Arab\" menghapus tasykil (fathah, dammah, kasrah, syaddah, dan lainnya) serta tatwil, dan huruf tetap ada.",
   "Is my text sent anywhere?": "Apakah teks saya dikirim ke mana pun?",
   "No. Everything happens in your browser. Nothing is uploaded or saved.": "Tidak. Semuanya terjadi di browser Anda. Tidak ada yang diunggah atau disimpan.",
   "Change text to UPPERCASE, lowercase, Title Case, Sentence case, camelCase or snake_case. Remove extra spaces, line breaks, duplicate lines and Arabic diacritics. Free, nothing is uploaded.": "Ubah teks menjadi HURUF BESAR, huruf kecil, Title Case, huruf awal kalimat, camelCase, atau snake_case. Hapus spasi berlebih, jeda baris, baris duplikat, dan harakat Arab. Gratis, tidak ada yang diunggah.",
